flowchart LR
  S[Canonical state envelope S] --> H[SHA256 / state_hash]
  H --> W[OP_RETURN PUSHBYTES_36 / h concatenated with LE32 r]
  R[Randomizer r] --> W
  W --> C[P2WSH: OP_0 PUSHBYTES_32 SHA256 w]
  C --> T[Same creating transaction T as the main-program output]
  T --> ID[txid T]
  ID --> X[Successor input 0 actually references txid T, 0]
